## Bundled in the package

### energyRt — `example_models$energyRt`

The `example_models` dataset bundles model source generated from energyRt's
BASE_UTOPIA scenario, in GAMS, GMPL and JuMP form, together with its parsed
multimod representation.

- **Source:** https://github.com/energyRt/energyRt
- **License:** GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)
- **Copyright:** The energyRt Development Team

This content is derived from energyRt's model templates and remains under
AGPL-3.0. Full text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html

```
This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
it under the terms of the GNU Affero General Public License as published
by the Free Software Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or
(at your option) any later version.

This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,
but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of
MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the
GNU Affero General Public License for more details.

You should have received a copy of the GNU Affero General Public License
along with this program.  If not, see <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.
```

> **Unresolved.** Apache-2.0 and AGPL-3.0 are only one-way compatible: Apache
> code may be incorporated into an AGPL work, not the reverse. Bundling
> AGPL-3.0 material inside an Apache-2.0 package therefore needs an explicit
> decision by the maintainers before public release — either relicensing the
> bundled energyRt content, replacing it with an Apache-compatible fixture, or
> distributing it separately. energyRt has co-authors beyond the multimod
> author, so this is not a unilateral change.

## In the repository, not in the package

`drafts/` is excluded from the built package (`^drafts$` in `.Rbuildignore`).
It contains a snapshot of OSeMOSYS source for the parked OSeMOSYS workstream:

- **Source:** https://github.com/OSeMOSYS/OSeMOSYS_GNU_MathProg
- **Files:** `src/osemosys.txt`, `tests/utopia.txt` (in `drafts/data-raw/osemosys_source.RData`)
- **Version:** v1.0.1 (2021-05-21)
- **License:** Apache License 2.0
- **Copyright:** [2010-2015] OSeMOSYS Forum steering committee — www.osemosys.org

The upstream Apache copyright header is preserved verbatim in the snapshot; the
upstream repository contains no `NOTICE` file. Apache-2.0 is compatible with
multimod's own license.

If the OSeMOSYS workstream is revived, cite:

Howells, M., Rogner, H., Strachan, N., Heaps, C., Huntington, H., Kypreos, S.,
Hughes, A., Silveira, S., DeCarolis, J., Bazilian, M., & Roehrl, A. (2011).
OSeMOSYS: The Open Source Energy Modeling System: An introduction to its ethos,
structure and development. *Energy Policy*, 39(10), 5850-5870.
https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enpol.2011.06.033
